"   mido                                                                        █"
"                                                                               █"
"  mid╭ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮     █"
"     │ j / k, ↓ / ↑, wheel          Scroll one line                      │     █"
"  A t│ Ctrl-d / Ctrl-u              Half page down / up                  │app  █"
"  doe│ Ctrl-f / Ctrl-b, Space       Page down / up                       │hted │"
"  cod│ g / G                        Top / bottom                         │     │"
"  (ht│ b                            Toggle the outline panel             │     │"
"     │ Tab / Shift-Tab              Cycle focus between the panes        │     │"
"     │ Tab then ← / →               Move focus in that direction         │     │"
"  Ins│ h / l                        Focus the outline / the document     │     │"
"  ───│ j / k in the outline         Move and follow, Enter returns       │     │"
"     │ Space, h / l in the outline  Fold, collapse / expand a section    │     │"
"  ▎ c│ - / = in the outline         Fold all / unfold all                │  sh │"
"     │ /                            Search, Enter to keep, Esc to cancel │     │"
"     │ n / N                        Next / previous match                │     │"
"  Use│ t                            Table of contents                    │     │"
"  ───│ r                            Reload the file                      │     │"
"     │ ?                            This help                            │     │"
"  ▎ m│ q                            Quit                                 │  sh │"
"  ▎ m╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────── any key closes ╯     │"
"  ▎ mido -p README.md       # print styled text to stdout, pipe it to less -R  │"
"  ▎ mido -w 80 notes.md     # cap the width (default: full terminal width)     │"
" stdin   /table  1/4                                        ? help  q quit  Top "
